# Lint / format / typecheck

- Format with oxfmt (`pnpm format` / `pnpm format:check`)
- Lint with Vite+ oxlint + oxlint-plugin-awscdk (`pnpm lint` / `vp lint`)
- Typecheck with `pnpm typecheck` (`tsc` for CDK + dashboard)
- Before finishing: `pnpm agent:check`
